          "normalized_title": "New Research Uncovers Lithium’s Surprising Effect on Alzheimer’s",
          "normalized_summary": "Scientists have identified new ways lithium chloride may interact with Alzheimer’s disease mechanisms at the cellular level. A new study from the University of Eastern Finland (UEF) suggests lithium chloride may influence several cellular processes linked to Alzheimer’s disease. Alzheimer’s disease (AD) is the most common type of dementia. One of its key features is [...]",
